                <start-time>00:11:45,796</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:49,253</end-time>
                <translation>可能就会变得非常危险啊</translation>
                <original>とても危険なところに行くなって思いますね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="246" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <marks>
