                <start-time>00:21:10,139</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:14,766</end-time>
                <translation>不安之所以是不安的</translation>
                <original>不安がそのために不安を感じているものは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="427" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:21:14,766</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:17,390</end-time>
                <translation>正是“在世存在”本身</translation>
                <original>世界内存在そのものである</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="428" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:21:19,723</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:22,602</end-time>
                <translation>在世存在
世界内存在</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="429" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:21:22,602</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:26,513</end-time>
                <translation>也就是说 自己活在这个世上这件事本身</translation>
                <original>つまりこの世に自分が生きていること自体が</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="430" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:21:26,513</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:28,351</end-time>
                <translation>就是不安的源头？</translation>
                <original>不安の源ってこと?</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="431" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:21:30,931</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:32,030</end-time>
                <translation>这更让人不安啊</translation>
                <original>さらに不安だ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="432" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:21:37,748</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:41,672</end-time>
                <translation>不安的源泉 名为“自己”的在世存在
不安の源泉　自分という世界内存在</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="433" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:21:42,522</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:45,705</end-time>
                <translation>自己是“在世存在”这件事</translation>
                <original>自分が世界内存在であるということ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="434" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:21:45,705</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:49,387</end-time>
                <translation>也就是说 自己活在这个世上这件事本身</translation>
                <original>つまり自分がこの世に生きているということ自体が</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="435" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:21:49,387</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:50,749</end-time>
                <translation>就是不安的源泉</translation>
                <original>不安の源泉であると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="436" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:21:50,749</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:53,730</end-time>
                <translation>因此 为了从这种不安中移开视线</translation>
                <original>だからそうした不安から目をそらすために</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="437" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:21:53,730</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:57,695</end-time>
                <translation>人类便不再思考自己的生活方式</translation>
                <original>人間は自分自身の生き方を考えるのをやめて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="438" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:21:57,695</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:59,152</end-time>
                <translation>将自己委身于“世人”
世人に身を委ねて</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="439" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:21:59,152</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:00,811</end-time>
                <translation>试图以此忘却不安</translation>
                <original>不安を忘れようとするんだと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="440" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:00,811</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:02,416</end-time>
                <translation>他是这么说的</translation>
                <original>と彼は言っています</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="441" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:02,416</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:04,767</end-time>
                <translation>比如说 稍微</translation>
                <original>例えばちょっとこういう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="442" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:04,767</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:07,851</end-time>
                <translation>请想象一下学生的情况</translation>
                <original>まあ学生のことを想像してみていただきたいんですが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="443" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:07,851</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:10,070</end-time>
                <translation>觉得去上学非常痛苦</translation>
                <original>学校へ行くのがとても辛くて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="444" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:10,070</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:11,897</end-time>
                <translation>变得无法去上学了</translation>
                <original>学校へ行けなくなっていると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="445" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:11,897</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:14,043</end-time>
                <translation>学生本来就应该去上学
学生は本来学校へ行くべきだ</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="446" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:14,043</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:17,157</end-time>
                <translation>通过将这种世间常识强加给自己</translation>
                <original>というこう世間の常識を自分に課すことで</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="447" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:17,157</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:19,720</end-time>
                <translation>结果就是在折磨自己</translation>
                <original>自分を苦しめていることになるわけですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="448" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:19,720</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:22,889</end-time>
                <translation>但是 如果抛弃了这种常识</translation>
                <original>でもじゃあこの常識を捨ててしまったら</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="449" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:22,889</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:25,317</end-time>
                <translation>这个学生就能得到救赎吗</translation>
                <original>この学生が救われるかというと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="450" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:25,317</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:27,016</end-time>
                <translation>事实并非如此</translation>
                <original>そうではないわけです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="451" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:27,016</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:29,610</end-time>
                <translation>自己去思考自己的生活方式
自分自身の生き方を自分で考えなければ</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="452" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:29,610</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:31,521</end-time>
                <translation>就成了他的唯一选择</translation>
                <original>ならなくなってしまうからですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="453" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:31,521</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:36,363</end-time>
                <translation>那样的话 与其被这种毫无确定之物的痛苦所折磨</translation>
                <original>そうすると何も確かなものがない苦しみに 苛まれるくらいだったら</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="454" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:36,363</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:38,116</end-time>
                <translation>还不如紧紧抓住确定的东西</translation>
                <original>確かなものにしがみついて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="455" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:38,116</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:42,297</end-time>
                <translation>痛苦着更好 就会开始这么想</translation>
                <original>その結果苦しい方がまだマシだ と思うようになってしまう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="456" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:42,297</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:45,777</end-time>
                <translation>所以就会逃避自我 变成“世人”</translation>
                <original>だから自分から逃げて世人になってしまうと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="457" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:45,777</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:47,370</end-time>
                <translation>我看丧失电影时嘛</translation>
                <original>ゾンビ映画とか見てるじゃないですか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="458" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:48,381</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:51,030</end-time>
                <translation>我啊 当超过半数的人都变成丧尸时</translation>
                <original>俺もう過半数ゾンビになった時点で</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="459" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:51,030</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:53,653</end-time>
                <translation>我会想“干脆当丧尸算了”</translation>
                <original>ゾンビでいいやって思うの</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="460" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:53,653</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:56,081</end-time>
                <translation>“世人”大概就是这种感觉吧</translation>
                <original>世人ってその感じかな</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="461" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:56,081</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:58,890</end-time>
                <translation>人会选择成为“世人” 去走那条路</translation>
                <original>じゃあ世人になってそっちの道に行った方が</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="462" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:58,890</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:01,314</end-time>
                <translation>会认为它更轻松就选</translation>
                <original>楽だと選ぶということは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="463" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:23:01,314</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:03,486</end-time>
                <translation>意味着这是一条无法逃避的道路呢</translation>
                <original>逃げられない道ということですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="464" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:23:03,486</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:06,277</end-time>
                <translation>但是 走上那条路就会变得不负责任</translation>
                <original>でもそっちに行くと無責任なんですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="465" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:23:06,277</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:08,759</end-time>
                <translation>那么 我们应该怎么思考这个问题才好呢？</translation>
                <original>これはどうしたらいいというふうに考えたらいいんですか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="466" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:23:08,759</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:11,443</end-time>
                <translation>海德格尔认为 人无论何时</translation>
                <original>ハイデガーは人間はどんな時でも</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="467" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:23:11,443</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:13,749</end-time>
                <translation>都在被“世人”所吞噬</translation>
                <original>世人に飲み込まれているというんですが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="468" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:23:13,749</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:17,714</end-time>
                <translation>但也有能够超越这种状态的瞬间</translation>
                <original>ただこの状態を乗り越えることができる瞬間もあると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="469" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:23:17,714</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:19,117</end-time>
                <translation>这是他的解法</translation>
                <original>いうふうに言うんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="470" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:23:19,117</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:20,810</end-time>
                <translation>那到底该怎么做</translation>
                <original>じゃあ一体どうすれば</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="471" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:23:20,810</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:23,932</end-time>
                <translation>此在才能取回本来性
現存在が本来性を取り戻して</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="472" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:23:23,932</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:25,955</end-time>
                <translation>并这样活下去呢？</translation>
                <original>生きていくことができるのか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="473" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:23:25,955</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:29,745</end-time>
